{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2020-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1606089600, "end_date": 1606780799, "month_true_total": 136, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:59:28 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "81251465", "author": {"steamid": "76561198337626778", "personaname": "Captain_Violet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198337626778/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 821, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 45, "last_played": 1624361272, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Unplayable. Game constantly tabbing out by itself, freezing, vanishing textures. Can't get an hour into it with all the bugs.\n\nEdit: After messing around with the settings and trying to play some more, I have to add: I cannot believe I paid money for this. What a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ scam.\n\nEdit: Alright, after much messing around with my PC's graphics settings, I've finally made the bugs go away. And now I feel like a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ space marine. The game captures the weight and momentum of power armour so well, smashing through hordes of enemies. You FEEL heavy and unstoppable. 100% worth the money and the time and irritation it took to un-buggify the damn thing.", "timestamp_created": 1606757052, "timestamp_updated": 1606791545, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81245099", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066828522", "personaname": "cerea1killer | aNa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cerea1killer/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2398, "playti